; The four cards are 240 x 240 -- ART_BIBLE section 8's floor, exactly -- and
; the picture inside each is a quieter 96 px box (the art covers 86% of it),
; the caption band under it holds two lines at the shared 30 pt size. Touch target and visible icon are separate
; numbers on purpose: the finger gets the whole card, the eye gets a sticker.
; Play with Bunny, Free Play and Dress Up carry PICTURES from the owner's pack
; (`IconGlyph` picture tier), including the softer lavender Parents gear.
